# Testing & Quality Bar

- New components in `features/{domain}/components/` get a colocated `.test.tsx` covering
  at minimum: loading state, empty state, and one populated-data render.
- New hooks in `features/{domain}/hooks/` get a test using a mocked query client.
- RBAC-sensitive components (anything wrapped in `<Can>`) get a test asserting it's hidden
  for at least one disallowed role.
- Run `tsc --noEmit`, `eslint`, and the relevant test file before considering any task
  done — do not hand back code that hasn't been typechecked.
- No `any` types without a `// eslint-disable-next-line` comment explaining why — prefer
  `unknown` + narrowing, or generate the type from the OpenAPI schema in `types/api/`.
